1. INTRODUCTION
================================================================

Casa OS 1 is an independent operating system project developed
with the purpose of creating a self-contained operating system
without depending on another operating system.

This project is publicly available to allow users, developers,
and interested individuals to explore, study, test, and provide
feedback about its development.

================================================================
2. PERMITTED ACTIVITIES
